        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-407, Swirl At Ends Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nReminiscent of natural themes, the Swirl Cabinet Pull will add warmth to any space. It is available in 6 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. The Swirl at Ends pull made by RK International has 3\" center to centers. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/swirl-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-207\"><b>CK-207 Swirl Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-407 Swirled Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CP-407-finishes.jpg?v=1704354714\" width=\"496\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
